.TH TARBZIPEX 1 "DTar Manual"
.SH NAME
tarbzipex \- extract a bzip2-compressed tarball
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tarbzipex
<archive> [path]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Extracts the contents of a bzip2-compressed tar archive to the given path (or current directory if not specified).
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I archive
The tar.bz2 archive to extract.
.TP
.I path
(Optional) Destination directory.